01:48:46.320 --> 01:48:53.119 align:start position:0%
congregationalists.
We now come to the first of the three

01:48:50.239 --> 01:48:57.280 align:start position:0%
great awakenings. These were periods of
increased religious fervor that led to

01:48:55.119 --> 01:49:01.840 align:start position:0%
the creation of even more new
denominations. Now, although the

01:48:59.280 --> 01:49:05.119 align:start position:0%
Baptists were around before this time,
it wasn't really until the first great

01:49:03.440 --> 01:49:10.159 align:start position:0%
awakening that their numbers really
started to grow. For example, it was at

01:49:07.920 --> 01:49:16.239 align:start position:0%
this point that many congregationalists,
inspired by all the increased religious

01:49:12.400 --> 01:49:20.080 align:start position:0%
fervor, began to identify as Baptist.
The other big denomination connected to

01:49:18.159 --> 01:49:25.679 align:start position:0%
the first great awakening is the
Methodist church. It was primarily built

01:49:22.880 --> 01:49:30.800 align:start position:0%
by former Anglicans, most notably a man
named John Wesley. Okay. Around 80 years

01:49:28.880 --> 01:49:35.040 align:start position:0%
later, there was a second great
awakening and this time things took

01:49:32.639 --> 01:49:40.000 align:start position:0%
place exclusively in the United States.
It attracted mainly congregationalists,

01:49:37.760 --> 01:49:44.400 align:start position:0%
Baptists, and Methodists, but then
shuffled many of them into new

01:49:41.920 --> 01:49:48.880 align:start position:0%
denominations, such as the Disciples of
Christ, and the Plymouth Brethren.

01:49:46.639 --> 01:49:53.280 align:start position:0%
However, the three largest denominations
that came about as a result of the

01:49:50.880 --> 01:49:58.560 align:start position:0%
Second Great Awakening are the 7th Day
Adventists, the Jehovah's Witnesses, and

01:49:56.239 --> 01:50:04.159 align:start position:0%
the Mormons. They differ from other
denominations in that they all departed

01:50:00.960 --> 01:50:08.719 align:start position:0%
from traditional nyine Christianity.
This is why they are shown in beige

01:50:06.080 --> 01:50:14.080 align:start position:0%
instead of purple except for the 7th day
adventists as they have since moved back

01:50:11.280 --> 01:50:18.480 align:start position:0%
towards nyine beliefs. All right.
Finally, we come to the third great

01:50:16.159 --> 01:50:23.760 align:start position:0%
awakening which initially started out as
a movement among Methodists leading to

01:50:21.119 --> 01:50:27.840 align:start position:0%
the creation of the holiness churches.
However, perhaps more importantly,

01:50:25.600 --> 01:50:32.719 align:start position:0%
following the Isuza Street revival in
Los Angeles, it also led to the

01:50:30.080 --> 01:50:37.520 align:start position:0%
Pentecostal movement and in turn the
