01:50:34.880 --> 01:50:41.440 align:start position:0%
associated with speaking in tongues. But
another key aspect of the third great

01:50:39.440 --> 01:50:46.400 align:start position:0%
awakening was the rise of
fundamentalism, which involves very

01:50:44.080 --> 01:50:50.239 align:start position:0%
literal interpretations of scripture and
very conservative viewpoints. While not

01:50:48.639 --> 01:50:55.760 align:start position:0%
a denomination of its own,
fundamentalism is followed by many

01:50:52.560 --> 01:51:01.119 align:start position:0%
Pentecostals and by many Baptists. At
the other end of the spectrum is the

01:50:57.679 --> 01:51:06.080 align:start position:0%
very liberal United Church of Christ,
which traces its roots back to the many

01:51:03.520 --> 01:51:10.199 align:start position:0%
independent congregationalist groups
