02:22:39.920 --> 02:22:47.520 align:start position:0%
construction trade to being more of a
social club for elites that had a

02:22:45.280 --> 02:22:52.319 align:start position:0%
complex organizational structure and
held all sorts of secrets. This proved

02:22:50.399 --> 02:22:57.840 align:start position:0%
useful for those interested in
rosacrruianism because it provided a

02:22:54.960 --> 02:23:02.240 align:start position:0%
model for creating rosacrruian secret
societies. The first of which was the

02:22:59.920 --> 02:23:07.760 align:start position:0%
order of the golden and rosy cross
founded in Germany in the 1750s. Take

02:23:05.280 --> 02:23:13.359 align:start position:0%
note that in order to be a member of the
order, one also had to be a master

02:23:10.479 --> 02:23:18.240 align:start position:0%
mason. Now, if there's one thing that I
can say with confidence about the

02:23:15.040 --> 02:23:23.600 align:start position:0%
Rosaians is that they made some really
cool charts. I'm not going to attempt to

02:23:21.359 --> 02:23:28.640 align:start position:0%
explain any of them because I'm not sure
that I could. But basically, they

02:23:26.000 --> 02:23:33.760 align:start position:0%
combine ideas taken from stuff like
hermeticism and cabala in an attempt to

02:23:31.439 --> 02:23:39.040 align:start position:0%
explain the world in a way that at least
looks orderly and scientific while at

02:23:36.720 --> 02:23:43.760 align:start position:0%
the same time retaining certain elements
from Christian theology. Probably the

02:23:41.439 --> 02:23:48.960 align:start position:0%
most well-known member of the order of
the golden and rosy cross was King

02:23:46.160 --> 02:23:53.520 align:start position:0%
Frederick II of Prussia who was the
successor to Frederick the Great.

02:23:51.439 --> 02:23:59.040 align:start position:0%
However, following his death, the order
eventually fizzled out. A bit later

02:23:55.760 --> 02:24:06.640 align:start position:0%
though, in 1865, a similar organization
was established in the UK called the

02:24:01.840 --> 02:24:12.720 align:start position:0%
Societus Rosacrusha in Anglia or Sria
for short. It actually still exists to

02:24:09.760 --> 02:24:18.240 align:start position:0%
this day. But perhaps more wellknown is
the hermetic order of the golden dawn

02:24:15.680 --> 02:24:22.640 align:start position:0%
which copied the structure of the
societrina

02:24:20.080 --> 02:24:27.680 align:start position:0%
but made two very important changes.
First it allowed women to join and

02:24:24.880 --> 02:24:32.640 align:start position:0%
second it modeled itself on ancient
paganism instead of maintaining ties to

02:24:30.560 --> 02:24:37.840 align:start position:0%
Christianity. Members of the order
included William Butler Yates and Sir

02:24:35.200 --> 02:24:42.960 align:start position:0%
Arthur Conan Doyle as well as A.E. We
wait and Pixie Smith. Those last two

02:24:40.319 --> 02:24:48.000 align:start position:0%
being the creators of the popular Ryder
weight tarot deck. However, the most

02:24:46.000 --> 02:24:52.960 align:start position:0%
important thing about the Order of the
Golden Dawn is that it introduced

02:24:50.319 --> 02:24:57.920 align:start position:0%
certain rituals and ceremonies that
supposedly involved powerful magic.

02:24:55.680 --> 02:25:02.960 align:start position:0%
These rituals would go on to be used by
other esoteric groups that I'll talk

02:25:00.319 --> 02:25:08.880 align:start position:0%
about later on. Another secret society
that modeled itself on Freemasonry and

02:25:06.160 --> 02:25:14.800 align:start position:0%
which had connections to Rosacrruianism
was the Ellis Cohens meaning the elect

02:25:12.160 --> 02:25:19.760 align:start position:0%
priests. Their full name being the order
of nightmasons elect priests of the

02:25:17.439 --> 02:25:25.359 align:start position:0%
universe. This organization later
inspired a Frenchman who went by the

02:25:22.080 --> 02:25:31.200 align:start position:0%
name Papus and who founded the Martinist
Order which despite its logo having a

02:25:28.160 --> 02:25:36.720 align:start position:0%
star of David was not Jewish. Now before
I move on away from Rosacrruianism and

02:25:34.319 --> 02:25:42.560 align:start position:0%
Freemasonry, I should mention the
influence that Freemasonry had on

02:25:39.120 --> 02:25:47.840 align:start position:0%
Mormonism. LDS founder Joseph Smith as
well as the next three LDS presidents

02:25:45.200 --> 02:25:51.840 align:start position:0%
are all known to have been Freemasons
and there are definitely some

02:25:49.040 --> 02:25:56.880 align:start position:0%
similarities between certain LDS rituals
and symbols and the rituals and symbols

02:25:54.080 --> 02:26:00.960 align:start position:0%
used within Freemasonry. So while the
Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day

02:25:58.560 --> 02:26:07.439 align:start position:0%
Saints is not generally considered to be
a part of Western esotericism, it does

02:26:03.760 --> 02:26:11.520 align:start position:0%
have some esoteric elements. Okay, I now
want to move over to another early

02:26:09.439 --> 02:26:14.880 align:start position:0%
movement within modern western
esotericism.

02:26:13.120 --> 02:26:19.840 align:start position:0%
Swedenborgianism
named after the Swedish polymath Emanuel

02:26:17.760 --> 02:26:24.560 align:start position:0%
Swedenborg among other things.
Swedenborg promoted the idea that some

02:26:22.399 --> 02:26:29.280 align:start position:0%
humans remain on earth after death
either as angels or demons and that such

02:26:27.280 --> 02:26:34.160 align:start position:0%
spirits can influence the living. While
not an official Christian doctrine, the

02:26:31.520 --> 02:26:38.880 align:start position:0%
idea that dead loved ones can live on as
ghosts or angels, is definitely a common

02:26:36.800 --> 02:26:43.280 align:start position:0%
folk belief held by many Christians
today. It was certainly a belief held by

02:26:41.280 --> 02:26:48.000 align:start position:0%
Joseph Smith, who claimed to have been
visited by the angel Moroni, who had

02:26:45.840 --> 02:26:52.880 align:start position:0%
previously lived on Earth as a human.
Anyway, Swedenberg did not establish a

02:26:50.640 --> 02:26:58.240 align:start position:0%
church during his lifetime, but after
his death, some of his followers did,

02:26:55.200 --> 02:27:03.200 align:start position:0%
and it became known as the new church.
Overlapping with the lifespan of Emanuel

02:27:01.040 --> 02:27:07.840 align:start position:0%
Swedenborg was that of a German
physician named Fron Mesmer whose name

02:27:06.319 --> 02:27:13.359 align:start position:0%
became the basis for the word
mesmerized. He taught the idea that

02:27:10.240 --> 02:27:18.000 align:start position:0%
there exists an invisible force that
connects all things and that this force

02:27:15.600 --> 02:27:22.880 align:start position:0%
can be manipulated in order to promote
healing. In fact, he developed certain

02:27:20.640 --> 02:27:28.240 align:start position:0%
techniques to do so. But here's where
things get interesting. Eventually,

02:27:24.960 --> 02:27:32.720 align:start position:0%
Swedenborg's ideas and Mesmer's ideas
were combined to form the idea that

02:27:30.640 --> 02:27:37.520 align:start position:0%
certain techniques can be used to
manipulate and communicate with the

02:27:34.800 --> 02:27:43.920 align:start position:0%
invisible spirits of dead relatives.
Thus, the movement known as spiritualism

02:27:40.960 --> 02:27:48.160 align:start position:0%
was born with the three fox sisters
becoming some of the very first mediums.

02:27:46.399 --> 02:27:54.880 align:start position:0%
Although they were later revealed to be
frauds, spiritualism was all the rage

02:27:51.200 --> 02:28:00.000 align:start position:0%
during the late 1800s and early 1900s,
but eventually it lost its popularity as

02:27:57.840 --> 02:28:05.359 align:start position:0%
science improved. Nevertheless, there
are still some spiritualist churches in

02:28:02.720 --> 02:28:11.040 align:start position:0%
the US that still exist to this day, and
these are now united under the National

02:28:07.840 --> 02:28:15.439 align:start position:0%
Spiritualist Association. And in Latin
America, a certain branch of

02:28:12.720 --> 02:28:21.439 align:start position:0%
spiritualism called Spiritism, founded
by Alan Cardik, remains extremely

02:28:18.319 --> 02:28:27.600 align:start position:0%
popular. Its largest organization, the
Brazilian Spiritist Federation, has

02:28:24.319 --> 02:28:33.280 align:start position:0%
almost 4 million members. Another
esoteric movement that can be traced to

02:28:29.840 --> 02:28:38.399 align:start position:0%
France Mesmer is New Thought, although
its founder was actually a follower of

02:28:35.600 --> 02:28:43.600 align:start position:0%
Mesmer named Phineas Quimby. The main
idea behind new thought is that one's

02:28:41.200 --> 02:28:49.760 align:start position:0%
mental state can have an impact on the
physical world. So if you've ever been

02:28:46.000 --> 02:28:55.680 align:start position:0%
told to think positively or that you can
manifest good things into your life, you

02:28:52.800 --> 02:29:00.240 align:start position:0%
can thank Phineas Quimby for that. There
are several new thought organizations

02:28:57.439 --> 02:29:06.000 align:start position:0%
that still exist today, including the
Unity Church, as well as several groups

02:29:02.960 --> 02:29:09.120 align:start position:0%
that use the religious science label.
Also connected to the new thought

02:29:07.520 --> 02:29:13.760 align:start position:0%
movement even though they don't
acknowledge it is Christian Science

02:29:11.760 --> 02:29:18.640 align:start position:0%
officially the church of Christ
scientist. Their founder Mary Baker

02:29:16.240 --> 02:29:25.280 align:start position:0%
Eddie happened to be a student of
Phineas Quimby and she incorporated many

02:29:21.280 --> 02:29:29.439 align:start position:0%
of his ideas into her own movement. So
as you can see from the chart it was

02:29:27.120 --> 02:29:35.040 align:start position:0%
during the 1800s that western
esotericism really took off and went in

02:29:32.720 --> 02:29:39.439 align:start position:0%
a bunch of different directions. Well,
of the many esoteric figures who were

02:29:37.280 --> 02:29:45.120 align:start position:0%
active during this period, perhaps the
most important was a Russian-born woman

02:29:42.080 --> 02:29:51.280 align:start position:0%
known as Helena Blavatski who founded
the Theosophical Society. Her system of

02:29:48.399 --> 02:29:56.960 align:start position:0%
thought known as Theosophy, meaning God
wisdom, combined for the first time all

02:29:54.080 --> 02:30:02.479 align:start position:0%
the ideas that the Rosacrruians had been
exploring with the ideas and practices

02:29:59.920 --> 02:30:06.880 align:start position:0%
coming out of the spiritualism movement.
So like other occultists, she believed

02:30:05.040 --> 02:30:12.800 align:start position:0%
that there had once been in the very
deep past a sort of universal human

02:30:10.000 --> 02:30:17.120 align:start position:0%
religion that had eventually been lost,
even though hints of it could be seen in

02:30:15.120 --> 02:30:21.280 align:start position:0%
every religion. However, she also
believed that there were certain masters

02:30:19.280 --> 02:30:26.479 align:start position:0%
who lived throughout history who knew
about this original truth and with whom

02:30:23.439 --> 02:30:31.760 align:start position:0%
she communicated. Her goal was thus to
reestablish a universal religion with

02:30:29.120 --> 02:30:37.040 align:start position:0%
the help of these masters, some of whom
were still alive and living in Tibet.

02:30:35.200 --> 02:30:41.920 align:start position:0%
Take note that the logo for the
Theosophical Society combines many

02:30:39.600 --> 02:30:46.560 align:start position:0%
ancient religious symbols, including a
snake eating its tail, which is

02:30:43.840 --> 02:30:53.520 align:start position:0%
associated with alchemy, but also a star
of David, an Egyptian enh, a Hindu M,

02:30:50.399 --> 02:30:58.640 align:start position:0%
and even a swastika, which before its
association with Nazism had been used

02:30:55.760 --> 02:31:03.840 align:start position:0%
for centuries by Buddhism and other
religions. However, there is in fact a

02:31:01.200 --> 02:31:09.520 align:start position:0%
real link between theosophy and the
racist ideas promoted by the Nazis. One

02:31:06.720 --> 02:31:15.840 align:start position:0%
of Blovatzk's ideas involved what she
called root races, which were connected

02:31:12.479 --> 02:31:20.880 align:start position:0%
to lost continents like Atlantis and
Leoria. She taught that the so-called

02:31:18.319 --> 02:31:26.479 align:start position:0%
Aryan race was currently the most
advanced one, an idea which led to a

02:31:23.520 --> 02:31:31.920 align:start position:0%
movement called arosophy, meaning wisdom
of the Aryans. This combined with the

02:31:29.359 --> 02:31:36.720 align:start position:0%
Vulkish movement which was an early
neopagan movement that sought to connect

02:31:34.399 --> 02:31:42.560 align:start position:0%
Germany back to its original roots led
to the formation of various occult

02:31:38.960 --> 02:31:47.439 align:start position:0%
groups such as the Thu Society from whom
the Nazis got the idea to use the

02:31:44.640 --> 02:31:52.240 align:start position:0%
swastika as their main symbol. Now, keep
in mind that the overall influence that

02:31:49.520 --> 02:31:57.520 align:start position:0%
the occult had on Nazism is often
overstated in an effort to make the

02:31:54.479 --> 02:32:01.280 align:start position:0%
Nazis seem even more evil and sinister
than they were, as if that was

02:31:59.120 --> 02:32:05.600 align:start position:0%
necessary. In reality, while there was
likely some influence, the Nazis were

02:32:03.600 --> 02:32:11.200 align:start position:0%
far more concerned with their political
agenda than they were with spiritual

02:32:08.000 --> 02:32:16.960 align:start position:0%
matters. Theosophy also had a direct
influence on anthroposophy which was

02:32:14.319 --> 02:32:21.840 align:start position:0%
founded by Rudolph Steiner and which you
might know about through its network of

02:32:18.960 --> 02:32:27.120 align:start position:0%
Waldorf schools. It attempts to combine
spirituality with the scientific method

02:32:24.160 --> 02:32:32.880 align:start position:0%
and places a big emphasis on free will.
Now, if the most important esotericist

02:32:29.600 --> 02:32:38.560 align:start position:0%
of the late 1800s was Helena Bulvatsky,
then the most important esotericist of

02:32:35.520 --> 02:32:43.920 align:start position:0%
the early 1900s was undoubtedly
Alistister Crowley. He was originally a

02:32:41.760 --> 02:32:49.439 align:start position:0%
member of the hermetic order of the
Golden Dawn, but then went on to develop

02:32:46.399 --> 02:32:54.319 align:start position:0%
his own system of thought known as the
Lima, which is a Greek word meaning

02:32:51.600 --> 02:33:02.399 align:start position:0%
divine will. It all started during his
honeymoon in Egypt in 1909 when a spirit

02:32:58.960 --> 02:33:06.960 align:start position:0%
supposedly dictated to him a text called
the book of the law. By this point, the

02:33:05.040 --> 02:33:13.120 align:start position:0%
order of the golden dawn had fallen
apart and Crowley had started his own

02:33:10.000 --> 02:33:18.800 align:start position:0%
organization called AA. It was therefore
through AA and also through another

02:33:16.000 --> 02:33:24.399 align:start position:0%
organization he joined called Otto that
he introduced the Lima. Like other

02:33:21.280 --> 02:33:29.439 align:start position:0%
esoteric ideologies, the Lima combines
ideas from a bunch of different sources.

02:33:27.120 --> 02:33:37.200 align:start position:0%
However, it stands out in that it puts
more of a focus on ceremonial magic,

02:33:33.040 --> 02:33:43.359 align:start position:0%
which it calls magic with a CK in order
to distinguish it from illusionist

02:33:39.680 --> 02:33:49.760 align:start position:0%
magic. These ceremonies included lots of
weird stuff, including sexual stuff. And

02:33:47.040 --> 02:33:55.120 align:start position:0%
this combined with Crowley's general
libertine lifestyle made him an

02:33:52.560 --> 02:33:58.880 align:start position:0%
extremely controversial figure. But
regardless of what one thinks of

02:33:56.640 --> 02:34:04.399 align:start position:0%
Alistair Crowley, there's no doubt that
his influence on esotericism continues

02:34:01.840 --> 02:34:08.640 align:start position:0%
to this day. For example, near the end
of his life, he became friends with

02:34:06.240 --> 02:34:14.080 align:start position:0%
Gerald Gardner, who helped develop what
is now known as Wikah. Crowley's

02:34:11.200 --> 02:34:20.000 align:start position:0%
writings also influenced Anton Ly who
founded the Church of Satan and even

02:34:16.399 --> 02:34:24.800 align:start position:0%
Elron Hubard who invented Scientology.
Although, as I mentioned in my video

02:34:22.080 --> 02:34:29.439 align:start position:0%
about atheist denominations, it's
important to know that the Church of

02:34:26.399 --> 02:34:35.280 align:start position:0%
Satan doesn't actually believe in a real
Satan. Now, speaking of Wikah, let me

02:34:32.160 --> 02:34:40.399 align:start position:0%
now say a few things about neopaganism.
The word pagan comes from the Latin word

02:34:37.680 --> 02:34:44.720 align:start position:0%
for rural and was used during the rise
of Christianity to describe those who

02:34:42.560 --> 02:34:48.960 align:start position:0%
followed the older polytheistic
religions instead. These religions

02:34:46.640 --> 02:34:54.560 align:start position:0%
eventually all went extinct being
stamped out by Christianity which is why

02:34:51.680 --> 02:35:00.160 align:start position:0%
pagans today are referred to as
neopagans. Now there are basically two

02:34:57.359 --> 02:35:06.000 align:start position:0%
main types of neopaganism.
First, there are the reconstructionist

02:35:02.560 --> 02:35:11.200 align:start position:0%
groups which try to literally bring back
or reconstruct particular pagan

02:35:09.040 --> 02:35:16.479 align:start position:0%
religions exactly as they would have
been followed in ancient times. So for

02:35:13.760 --> 02:35:21.840 align:start position:0%
example, Hellenism is an attempt to
bring back the worship of Greek gods

02:35:19.359 --> 02:35:28.080 align:start position:0%
whereas heathenry is an attempt to bring
back the worship of German gods. In

02:35:24.800 --> 02:35:34.720 align:start position:0%
contrast, eclectic neopaganism
is more of a mishmash in which general

02:35:31.840 --> 02:35:40.160 align:start position:0%
pagan ideas and practices are promoted
without necessarily focusing on just one

02:35:37.040 --> 02:35:45.120 align:start position:0%
type. So, one example would be druidry,
which promotes harmony and worship of

02:35:42.560 --> 02:35:51.120 align:start position:0%
nature gods in general and is far less
exact in its aims, unlike Celtic

02:35:48.000 --> 02:35:57.840 align:start position:0%
reconstructionism, which is however of
all the types of eclectic neopaganism,

02:35:54.560 --> 02:36:03.280 align:start position:0%
Wikah is by far the most popular and
most well-known. Originating in the UK,

02:36:01.280 --> 02:36:08.960 align:start position:0%
it is strongly associated with the
concept of witches. After all, the word

02:36:05.760 --> 02:36:15.280 align:start position:0%
wikah is simply the old English word for
sorcerer. But unlike other types of

02:36:12.000 --> 02:36:19.840 align:start position:0%
esotericism, wikah has no central
structure or organization. Most

02:36:17.760 --> 02:36:24.720 align:start position:0%
practitioners simply practice on their
own, incorporating Wiccan customs into

02:36:22.240 --> 02:36:28.880 align:start position:0%
their life as they see fit. Now I should
point out that while Wikah tends to

02:36:26.399 --> 02:36:34.479 align:start position:0%
attract slightly more women than men,
there are in fact male Wiccans and the

02:36:31.439 --> 02:36:38.720 align:start position:0%
word witch can be used for a male. Some
Wiccans do put a stronger emphasis on

02:36:36.880 --> 02:36:43.200 align:start position:0%
the divine mother and hence there is
some overlap with another group called

02:36:40.960 --> 02:36:48.479 align:start position:0%
the goddess movement. All right. Now the
last thing I need to do is explain how

02:36:45.439 --> 02:36:52.960 align:start position:0%
the new age movement fits into all of
this. Nowadays, a lot of the things

02:36:50.800 --> 02:36:59.600 align:start position:0%
we've been discussing simply end up
being labeled as new age. That's because

02:36:56.479 --> 02:37:04.560 align:start position:0%
new age did in fact end up incorporating
a bunch of different esoteric movements

02:37:01.680 --> 02:37:11.359 align:start position:0%
under one big umbrella. So, for example,
it draws from neopaganism, theosophy,

02:37:08.240 --> 02:37:17.439 align:start position:0%
spiritualism, and new thought. However,
it also borrows elements from one of the

02:37:14.240 --> 02:37:23.280 align:start position:0%
newest types of esotericism, UFO
religions. These started springing up in

02:37:20.319 --> 02:37:28.960 align:start position:0%
the 1950s following the famous Roswell
incident. The best known UFO religion is

02:37:26.000 --> 02:37:34.479 align:start position:0%
probably Raism led by a Frenchman that
goes by the name Raal. According to

02:37:31.280 --> 02:37:39.040 align:start position:0%
Raalism, all of humanity's stories about
God or the gods are actually based on

02:37:37.040 --> 02:37:44.560 align:start position:0%
memories of an advanced species of
aliens that visited Earth in the distant

02:37:41.359 --> 02:37:49.200 align:start position:0%
past, which it calls the Alohim. They
also teach that the Alohim continued to

02:37:47.120 --> 02:37:53.760 align:start position:0%
visit Earth and that they communicate
with the group's leader, Rahul. Now,

02:37:51.680 --> 02:37:59.280 align:start position:0%
when it comes to new age, things are not
as specific as that. After all, there is

02:37:56.880 --> 02:38:03.359 align:start position:0%
no central leadership or any structure
at all to the new age movement. So,

02:38:01.520 --> 02:38:07.840 align:start position:0%
different people who practice new age
often believe different things or at

02:38:05.359 --> 02:38:12.720 align:start position:0%
least focus on different things. So,
while not all newagers believe in

02:38:09.760 --> 02:38:17.680 align:start position:0%
aliens, it's not uncommon for newagers
to believe in some sort of helpers,

02:38:15.120 --> 02:38:23.200 align:start position:0%
whether they be divine spirits, dead
relatives, or extraterrestrials. The

02:38:20.479 --> 02:38:28.479 align:start position:0%
term new age itself has a direct
connection to outer space. You see,

02:38:25.760 --> 02:38:34.720 align:start position:0%
every 2,000 years or so, the spring
equinox moves from one zodiac

02:38:31.920 --> 02:38:40.240 align:start position:0%
constellation to another. We've been in
the age of Pisces since around the time

02:38:37.439 --> 02:38:45.359 align:start position:0%
of Jesus, but we'll soon be entering the
